    "image_with_text_KmV77t": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_3nFpKM": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Adhesive tape plays a vital role in many industrial applications, from sealing packages to marking hazards or repairing damaged items. Standard tapes are versatile and available in materials suited to a wide range of uses, but custom tapes provide added advantages for companies with specific requirements. For example, custom-printed tape offers a cost-effective way to enhance brand visibility or clearly label equipment with safety information. Custom tapes can also be designed with specialized features such as anti-slip textures, waterproof finishes, perforations, and more.</p><p>At NADCO, we specialize in single-source solutions for custom adhesive tapes of all kinds. With our comprehensive prototyping, printing, and die-cutting services, we fulfill challenging custom tape orders in-house and to precise specifications. </p><p>In this guide, we outline some of the primary capabilities of custom tapes, including their composition and applications. However, if you have specific questions about your requirements, the adhesive experts at NADCO would be happy to guide you.</p>",
            "subtext_color": true
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_3nFpKM"
      ],
