    "rich_text_NJaYtM": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_BRUyzW": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Applications of Custom Adhesive Tapes",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_EfWhpF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Although adhesive tapes are often thought of as packaging materials, custom tapes find applications across manufacturing, medicine, retail, and other industries. By choosing a custom tape, industry professionals can achieve the precise combination of mechanical, chemical, and aesthetic characteristics that will suit their application. Some applications that benefit from custom tapes include:</p><ul><li>Labeling workplace hazards for an organized and OSHA-compliant environment</li><li>Marking floors for proper social distancing</li><li>Sealing and decorating packages with custom graphics</li><li>Applying instructions to equipment or fragile packages</li><li>Gently securing medical devices to sensitive skin</li></ul><p>Simple adjustments to tape material and design make it easy and affordable to create solutions tailored to any of these applications. </p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_BRUyzW",
        "text_EfWhpF"
      ],
      "name": "t:sections.rich-text.name",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "use_color_scheme_in_container": false,
        "content_spacing": "standard",
        "content_alignment": "left",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 50,
        "show_section_divider": false,
        "divider_width": "fixed"
      }
    },
    "rich_text_GDaj8F": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_cXT6iP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Custom Adhesive Tape Benefits and Features",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_x83XE4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Although a carefully selected stock tape will serve most applications well, nothing compares to the utility of a completely customized solution. Some benefits of custom tapes over other options include:</p><ul><li><strong>Opportunities to Distinguish Your Brand: </strong>Using custom tapes to seal packages is an economical way to set packaging apart and differentiate your brand from the competition. Paper tapes, in particular, allow marketers to attach high-fidelity logos and graphics that draw the eye and capture your brand image. </li><li><strong>Informative Text and Graphics: C</strong>ustom tapes serve as clear, visual communication tools to quickly identify and mark safety hazards, establish efficient traffic and pedestrian flow, and convey crucial, site-specific warnings or instructions.</li><li><strong>Unbeatable Safety Features: </strong>Whether your application calls for tamper-resistance, anti-slip textures, or FDA-compliant composition, custom tapes ensure uncompromising performance in your specific setting. Also, when processing custom orders, batch numbers allow for traceability in sensitive medical or food-related applications, and custom graphics make it easy to distinguish genuine products from fakes.</li><li><strong>Maximum Convenience: </strong>Custom tapes reduce the need to trim or write on generic adhesive products, saving time in facilities that use tape in repetitive applications.</li></ul><p>These advantages give custom adhesive tapes the edge in both cost and convenience, ensuring maximum ROI for clients with unique specifications.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_cXT6iP",
        "text_x83XE4"
      ],
