    "rich_text_MJma3y": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_DX8JPB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Get Started on Your Custom Tape Solution With NADCO",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_3nWbkY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When you need a custom adhesive tape, it’s critical to choose a provider who can handle your needs with minimal outsourcing or delays. NADCO’s expert design and in-house manufacturing guarantee that you will receive timely and high-quality services at every stage of the development process. To learn more about how our custom tape offerings can save you time and money, contact our team today.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
